<title>USA: CCC buys 4,410 tonnes U.S. SRW wheat for Senegal.</title>
<headline>CCC buys 4,410 tonnes U.S. SRW wheat for Senegal.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp said it bought 4,410 tonnes U.S. soft red winter wheat under the export donation program to Senegal.</p>
<p>The wheat was acquired from ADM, Decatur, Illinois, at $168.50 a tonne for October 5-31 shipment.</p>
<p>The CCC is part of the U.S. Department of Agriculture.</p>
<p>--Doris Frankel 312-983-7305</p>
</text>
